EXIT GATE varies by tier:
- SIMPLE (feature requirements covered by 1-3 tasks, AC clear)
- STANDARD (PRD requirements map to tasks, test cases mapped)
- COMPLEX (full write-task.md checklist, contract validation task if applicable)

